    "purpose": "Curated seed of REAL marketed drug BRAND (proprietary) names + high-collision INN generics, for the trademark-brand pre-screen (Axis 5b). Complements usan_stems.json (which covers INN STEM suffixes only). This file catches the failure the 2026 audit found: 'Claranta' passed the INN-stem check but collides with the clarithromycin / Claritin brand family and is a registered Class 5 pharmaceutical mark in India — a brand-level collision an INN-stem scan structurally cannot see.",
    "compiled_date": "2026-Q3",
    "coverage_note": "Seed list — NOT exhaustive. A clean result here is NEVER proof of trademark clearance; it only means no hit against this seed. Live multi-jurisdiction TM search (WIPO Global Brand DB, USPTO, EUIPO/TMview, TÜRKPATENT, Indian IP registry) remains mandatory.",
    "extensibility_note": "Append {brand, inn, atc, class, jurisdiction} rows; the distinctive-prefix + LASA screen picks them up automatically."
  },
